/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T10:17:54-08:00","id":818555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/814846-beast-homebrew-folder?p=818524#post818524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the directions, I'll begin collecting them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe subscribe to the thread, too, so that you can be alerted of any submissions? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/540642-homebrew-nightmares?p=818549#post818549\">I just added this in.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T04:13:59-08:00","id":819755,"title":"","content":"Adding in another addition to the Nightmares sub-folder. Is there anything already like it in the Beast corebook?<br /> <br /> -=-<br /> <br /> <b><u>You Cannot Hide</u><br /> Dice Pool:</b> Wits + Satiety vs. Composure + Supernatural Advantage<br /> <br /> <b>Normal Effect:</b> The victim does not benefit from the 10-again rule and suffers a -2 penalty to all Larceny, Stealth, and Subterfuge rolls.<br /> <br /> <b>High Effect:</b> The victim now suffers a -4 penalty to all Larceny, Stealth, and Subterfuge rolls, and treats only 10s as successes.<br /> <br /> <b>Satiety Expenditure:</b> The victim must now spend a Willpower point to attempt any Larceny, Stealth, or Subterfuge roll, and treats all failures as dramatic failures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T07:11:55-08:00","id":819792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deionscribe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/814846-beast-homebrew-folder?p=819755#post819755\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Adding in another addition to the Nightmares sub-folder. Is there anything already like it in the Beast corebook?<br /> <br /> -=-<br /> <br /> <b><u>You Cannot Hide</u><br /> Dice Pool:</b> Wits + Satiety vs. Composure + Supernatural Advantage<br /> <br /> <b>Normal Effect:</b> The victim does not benefit from the 10-again rule and suffers a -2 penalty to all Larceny, Stealth, and Subterfuge rolls.<br /> <br /> <b>High Effect:</b> The victim now suffers a -4 penalty to all Larceny, Stealth, and Subterfuge rolls, and treats only 10s as successes.<br /> <br /> <b>Satiety Expenditure:</b> The victim must now spend a Willpower point to attempt any Larceny, Stealth, or Subterfuge roll, and treats all failures as dramatic failures.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm not sure if there's anything like it in the book. Lemme have a check. thanks for helping me with this by the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T09:20:09-08:00","id":819832,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/814846-beast-homebrew-folder#post814846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello everyone! As I said I would, here's a folder for any kind of homebrew for beast. If anyone has any suggestions for things to add, please tell me.<br /> <br /> Here's the link:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:22px\">https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0B9KaEz_D7phwLVdETVZ0XzZoTFk&amp;usp=sha ring</span></div> </div> </div> </div>A Merits folder would be nice. Then I could post that Astral Panoply style merit I'm working on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T09:53:22-08:00","id":819845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hexmeister Vic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/814846-beast-homebrew-folder?p=819832#post819832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A Merits folder would be nice. Then I could post that Astral Panoply style merit I'm working on.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> OK, I'll get on that now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T09:54:55-08:00","id":819847,"title":"","content":"OK, it's added now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T09:55:33-08:00","id":819848,"title":"","content":"If you want any merits or whatever posted, if you could just post them on here or put a link up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T20:08:42-08:00","id":823001,"title":"","content":"A couple of Kinship Nightmares I worked out.<br /> <br /> -=-<br /> <br /> <b><u>Your Attacks Are Futile</u> [Changeling]</b><br /> <b>Dice Pool:</b> Wits + Satiety vs. Resolve + Supernatural Advantage<br /> <br /> <b>Normal Effect:</b> While under the effects of the Nightmare, the target does not benefit from the 10-again quality on all rolls made to target a specific body part.<br /> <br /> <b>High Satiety:</b> The Beast's ability to stifle the momentum of one's strikes becomes even more detrimental to those who deign to challenge him. The victim of this Nightmare must roll an Exceptional Success in his attacks to inflict Tilts resulting from striking a specified body part.<br /> <br /> <b>Satiety Expenditure: </b>The victim treats all failures in attack rolls as dramatic failures, and doubles all penalties from targeting a specific body part for the duration of the Nightmare. An attack aimed at the head, for example, suffers a -6 penalty instead of the usual -3.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>You Will Know Pain</u> [Sin-Eater]<br /> Dice Pool: </b>Presence + Satiety vs. Stamina + Supernatural Advantage<br /> <br /> <b>Normal Effect:</b> The victim begins taking wound penalties after a number of Health dots equal to his Stamina are filled with lethal damage. These penalties max out at -5, and last until the end of the scene.<br /> <br /> <b>High Satiety:</b> The victim begins taking wound penalties whenever he incurs lethal damage.<br /> <br /> <b>Satiety Expenditure:</b> By spending a point of Satiety, the Nightmare causes even the most superficial of injuries to inflict crippling pain. The effects of the Nightmare apply, now, with bashing damage,","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T23:17:11-08:00","id":823102,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deionscribe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/814846-beast-homebrew-folder?p=823001#post823001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A couple of Kinship Nightmares I worked out.<br /> <br /> -=-<br /> <br /> <b><u>Your Attacks Are Futile</u> [Changeling]</b><br /> <b>Dice Pool:</b> Wits + Satiety vs. Resolve + Supernatural Advantage<br /> <br /> <b>Normal Effect:</b> While under the effects of the Nightmare, the target does not benefit from the 10-again quality on all rolls made to target a specific body part.<br /> <br /> <b>High Satiety:</b> The Beast's ability to stifle the momentum of one's strikes becomes even more detrimental to those who deign to challenge him. The victim of this Nightmare must roll an Exceptional Success in his attacks to inflict Tilts resulting from striking a specified body part.<br /> <br /> <b>Satiety Expenditure: </b>The victim treats all failures in attack rolls as dramatic failures, and doubles all penalties from targeting a specific body part for the duration of the Nightmare. An attack aimed at the head, for example, suffers a -6 penalty instead of the usual -3.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>You Will Know Pain</u> [Sin-Eater]<br /> Dice Pool: </b>Presence + Satiety vs. Stamina + Supernatural Advantage<br /> <br /> <b>Normal Effect:</b> The victim begins taking wound penalties after a number of Health dots equal to his Stamina are filled with lethal damage. These penalties max out at -5, and last until the end of the scene.<br /> <br /> <b>High Satiety:</b> The victim begins taking wound penalties whenever he incurs lethal damage.<br /> <br /> <b>Satiety Expenditure:</b> By spending a point of Satiety, the Nightmare causes even the most superficial of injuries to inflict crippling pain. The effects of the Nightmare apply, now, with bashing damage,</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for dropping these off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T18:47:23-08:00","id":823927,"title":"","content":"The normal effect of Attacks Are Futile looks... a little weak. Is attacking specific parts really common enough that not having 10-again on it is a huge deal? I have trouble seeing why I'd use it in combat over All Your Teeth Are Falling Out or You Must Obey.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-13T00:57:59-08:00","id":1348184,"title":"","content":"This is actually an idea I\u2019ve had rattling around in my skull for a while. Heck, I\u2019ve even compiled a list of Homebrew Beast Families! Here they are;<br /> <br /> ??????? - Nightmares of Betrayal<br /> <br /> Irkalla - Nightmares of The End<br /> <br /> Kishin - Nightmares of Conflict<br /> <br /> Typhon - Nightmares of Chaos<br /> <br /> I\u2019ve also found a fan-made hunger;<br /> <br /> Festives - Hunger For Holiday Spirit<br /> <br /> And here\u2019s some Inheritances I came across (though I\u2019ve added to the names to fit the naming scheme);<br /> <br /> The Adoption - The Kin Joined<br /> <br /> The Antagonism - The Hero Justified<br /> <br /> The Cloistering - The Beast Retreats<br /> <br /> The Devotion - The Beast Smitten<br /> <br /> The Graduation - The Beast Accepted<br /> <br /> The Symbiosis - The Beast Cooperative<br /> <br /> I\u2019ll report back with the threads at a later date.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":".  Misspelt one of the Family names 03-21-2021, 05:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-21T14:48:47-07:00","id":1440861,"title":"","content":"Okay, I've yet to track down the Inheritances, but I've managed to locate the Hunger and all but one of the Families; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1203897-new-family-irkalla-nightmare-of-the-end\">Irkalla</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1077644-nightmares-of-conflict\">Kishin</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/896661-help-with-the-typhons\">Typhon</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1170442-christmas-bonus-klaus-krampus\">Festives</a>. I've also found the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1412814-the-automata-family\">Automata, Nightmares of Technology</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":". 03-22-2021, 05:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}